  "rationale": "The retained agenda (recording 118306) contains an explicit convening clause: 'the Library Board of the City of Denton, Texas will convene in a Regular Meeting on Thursday, April 8, 2021, at 3:30 p.m. in the Council Work Session Room at City Hall.' The same agenda interchangeably uses 'Library Advisory Board' in its registration guidelines, confirming both labels refer to this one body; the 'Council Work Session Room' is only the venue, not a City Council work session. All seven named participants (President Kate Margolis, Vice President Jean Greenlaw, Laura Cantu, Vicki Byrd, Jim Owen, Benjamin Huttash, Ling Jeng) are Library Board members participating via video/teleconference, so no joint convening body is proven and none is asserted. The provider player title 'Library Board on 2021-04-08 3:30 PM - Denton, TX' corroborates the recording's date and body label. The existing feed 'denton-tx-library-board' is described as 'Meetings of the Denton Library Board,' a direct title-and-scope match to the convened body, so assign_existing is used. Routine public comment procedures do not add Public Info feed membership, and no other feed's scope (Airport Advisory, Parks, etc.) matches this body."
